### 04 fill_phase (`04-fill-phase.patch`, 157 lines)
- `LLAMA_EXPERT_FILL_MIN_TOKENS`, `_MAX_TOKENS`, `_RANDOM=decode`. `expert_fill_phase(n_tokens)` (`llama-context.cpp:957`, called `:2341`):
